{
  "id": "p17",
  "title": "The Fourth Sample",
  "titleZh": "第四瓶水样",
  "topic": "环境调查",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My idea began in a college class about our local environment.",
        "zh": "这个想法始于一节关于本地环境的大学课。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My teacher let six students study the stream near a small dairy farm.",
        "zh": "老师让我们六个学生去研究一个小奶牛场边的小溪。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We could feel a sense that something was wrong here.",
        "zh": "我们能感觉到这里有什么不对。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This water had a strange smell and a red tint.",
        "zh": "这水有一股怪味，还泛着红色。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A thin leaf floated past, and then more came.",
        "zh": "一片薄叶子漂过去，接着来了更多。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the first week we set each plate in the cool lab.",
        "zh": "第一周里，我们把每个盘子摆进凉爽的实验室。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We brought enough bottles to collect one sample at each river bend.",
        "zh": "我们带够了瓶子，要在每个河湾取一份样本。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My legs ached as we carried the jars to the bridge.",
        "zh": "我们把罐子提到桥边时，我的腿都酸了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The farmer met us there with his old uncle.",
        "zh": "农夫带着他的老叔叔在那里迎我们。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He was very patient as he told us about his chickens.",
        "zh": "他非常耐心地跟我们讲他的鸡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Seventy years had passed since the brook ran clear.",
        "zh": "七十年过去了，这条小溪才重新变清。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He liked to speak of winters when the water would freeze.",
        "zh": "他喜欢说起水会结冰的那些冬天。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Then he spoke about culture and the sharing of wells.",
        "zh": "接着他讲起当地习俗和共用井水的事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A large, oily film covered the fourth cold sample.",
        "zh": "一层大片油膜盖住了第四份冰冷的样本。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We made a short video to explain the numbers to our grade.",
        "zh": "我们做了个短片，向年级解释这些数字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His words gave us plenty to discuss on the long way back.",
        "zh": "他的话让我们回去的长路上有得可讨论。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Everything pointed to a plant up the brook, beyond the bend.",
        "zh": "一切都指向河湾上游的一家工厂。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A finger of colour spread and the pool turned red.",
        "zh": "一缕颜色蔓延开，水潭变红了。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We joined the old man and found a pipe under a bed of stones.",
        "zh": "我们跟着老人，在石床下找到了一根管子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "By luck, he knew the old pipe and matched it very fast.",
        "zh": "多亏运气，他认得那根旧管子，很快就配上了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He fixed it in a day, and the whole brook ran clear.",
        "zh": "他一天就修好了，整条小溪重新变清。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We could hardly believe how fast it came back.",
        "zh": "我们几乎不敢相信它恢复得这么快。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A plane crossed the sky while we packed our things below.",
        "zh": "一架飞机掠过天空，我们在下面收拾东西。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The sun began to burn, so we dropped our bags in the shade.",
        "zh": "太阳开始灼人，我们把包丢在树荫下。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the town began to wake up, and it was a nice surprise.",
        "zh": "后来小镇醒了过来，那是个不错的惊喜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Many neighbours joined us at the old bridge that day.",
        "zh": "那天很多邻居在老桥边加入了我们。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The school praised our quiet involvement and clear communication.",
        "zh": "学校表扬了我们安静的参与和清楚的沟通。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our offering was small, but every penny helped a little.",
        "zh": "我们的捐赠不多，但每一分钱都起了点作用。"
      }
    ]
  ],
